      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Delta%2C_Louisiana",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Delta is a designated stop on the Louisiana African American Heritage Trail, honoring regional civil‑rights history.",
